{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 71,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.71.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.71.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In thee, O Jehovah, do I take refuge:\nLet me never be put to shame.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.71.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.71.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Deliver me in thy righteousness, and rescue me:\nBow down thine ear unto me, and save me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.71.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.71.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Be thou to me a rock of habitation, whereunto I may continually resort:\nThou hast given commandment to save me;\nFor thou art my rock and my fortress.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.71.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.71.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Rescue me, O my God, out of the hand of the wicked,\nOut of the hand of the unrighteous and cruel man.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.71.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.71.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For thou art my hope, O Lord Jehovah:",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou art",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my trust from my youth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.71.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.71.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "By thee have I been holden up from the womb;\nThou art he that took me out of my mother’s bowels:\nMy praise shall be continually of thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.71.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.71.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I am as a wonder unto many;\nBut thou art my strong refuge.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.71.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.71.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My mouth shall be filled with thy praise,\nAnd with thy honor all the day.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.71.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.71.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Cast me not off in the time of old age;\nForsake me not when my strength faileth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.71.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.71.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For mine enemies speak concerning me;\nAnd they that watch for my soul take counsel together,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.71.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.71.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Saying, God hath forsaken him:\nPursue and take him; for there is none to deliver.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.71.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.71.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O God, be not far from me;\nO my God, make haste to help me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.71.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.71.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let them be put to shame ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " consumed that are adversaries to my soul;\nLet them be covered with reproach and dishonor that seek my hurt.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.71.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.71.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I will hope continually,\nAnd will praise thee yet more and more.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.71.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.71.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My mouth shall tell of thy righteousness,",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "And",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of thy salvation all the day;\nFor I know not the numbers ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "thereof",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.71.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.71.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will come with the mighty acts of the Lord Jehovah:\nI will make mention of thy righteousness, even of thine only.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.71.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.71.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O God, thou hast taught me from my youth;\nAnd hitherto have I declared thy wondrous works.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.71.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.71.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yea, even when I am old and grayheaded, O God, forsake me not,\nUntil I have declared thy strength unto ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the next",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " generation,\nThy might to every one that is to come.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.71.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.71.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thy righteousness also, O God, is very high;\nThou who hast done great things, O God, who is like unto thee?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.71.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.71.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou, who hast showed us many and sore troubles,\nWilt quicken us again,\nAnd wilt bring us up again from the depths of the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.71.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.71.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Increase thou my greatness,\nAnd turn again and comfort me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.71.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.71.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will also praise thee with the psaltery,",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy truth, O my God:\nUnto thee will I sing praises with the harp,\nO thou Holy One of Israel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.71.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.71.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My lips shall shout for joy when I sing praises unto thee;\nAnd my soul, which thou hast redeemed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.71.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.71.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My tongue also shall talk of thy righteousness all the day long;\nFor they are put to shame, for they are confounded, that seek my hurt.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "Prayer of an old man for deliverance.",
      "before_verse": 1
    }
  ]
}
